{
  "title": "The Comprehensive Ziyarat of the Imams (a.s.)",
  "data": "Ghusl\nThis ziyarat can be recited when visiting any of the Imams (a.s.), in any month and on any day. Its steps follow one another in the order of these tabs.\nWhile performing ghusl for the ziyarat, recite:\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ وَبِاللّٰهِ\nBISMILLAAHI WA BILLAAH\nIn the Name of Allah (I begin), in Allah (I trust),\nوَفِيْ سَبِيْلِ اللّٰهِ وَعَلٰى مِلَّةِ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nWA FEE SABEELILLAAHI WA A'LAA MILLATI RASOOLILLAAH\nin the way of Allah (I proceed), and on the creed of the Messenger of Allah.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اغْسِلْ عَنِّيْ دَرَنَ الذُّنُوْبِ وَوَسَخَ الْعُيُوْبِ\nALLAAHUMMAGH SIL A'NNEE DARANADH DHUNOOBI WA WASAKHAL U'YOOB\nO Allah, (please do) cleanse me from the filth of sins and the dirt of defects,\nوَطَهِّرْنِيْ بِمَاۤءِ التَّوْبَةِ وَاَلْبِسْنِيْ رِدَاۤءَ الْعِصْمَةِ\nWA TAHHIRNEE BIMAA'IT TAWBATI WA ALBISNEE RIDAA'AL I'SMAH\npurify me with the water of repentance, dress me the garb of protection (against sinning),\nوَاَيِّدْنِيْ بِلُطْفٍ مِنْكَ يُوَفِّقُنِيْ لِصَالِحِ الْاَعْمَالِ\nWA AYYIDNEE BILUTFIN MINKA YUWAFFIQUNEE LISAALIHIL A'MAAL\nand aid me with Your compassion on account of which You may lead me to (doing) righteous deeds.\nاِنَّكَ ذُو الْفَضْلِ الْعَظِيْمِ\nINNAKA DHUL FADLIL A'ZEEM\nYou are verily the Lord of great favor.",
  "tabs": [
    "At the Shrine Gate\nWhen you reach the gate of the shrine, recite:\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِيْ وَفَّقَنِيْ لِقَصْدِ وَلِيِّهٖ\nAL-HAMDU LILLAAHIL LADHEE WAFFAQANEE LIQASDI WALIYYIH\nAll praise be to Allah Who has led me to come to His intimate servant\nوَزِيَارَةِ حُجَّتِهٖ وَاَوْرَدَنِيْ حَرَمَهٗ\nWA ZIYAARATI HUJJATIHEE WA AWRADANEE HARAMAH\nand to visit His argument-person (against creatures) and has allowed me to enter the precinct of him (i.e. His intimate servant);\nوَلَمْ يَبْخَسْنِيْ حَظِّيْ مِنْ زِيَارَةِ قَبْرِهٖ\nWA LAM YABKHASNEE HAZZEE MIN ZIYAARATI QABRIH\nthus, He has not deprived me of the opportunity to visit the tomb of him\nوَالنُّزُوْلِ بِعَقْوَةِ مُغَيَّبِهٖ وَسَاحَةِ تُرْبَتِهِ\nWAN NUZOOLI BI-A'QWATI MUGHAYYABIHEE WA SAAHATI TURBATIH\nand to stay at the patio of his shrine and at the courtyard of his grave.\nالْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِيْ لَمْ يَسِمْنِيْ بِحِرْمَانِ مَاۤ اَمَّلْتُهٗ\nAL-HAMDU LILLAAHIL LADHEE LAM YASIMNEE BIHIRMAANI MAA AMMALTUH\nAll praise be to Allah Who has not decided for me the deprivation of that which I hope,\nوَلَا صَرَفَ عَنِّيْ مَا رَجَوْتُهٗ\nWA LAA SARAFA A'NNEE MAA RAJAWTUH\nhas not prevented me against that for which I have longed\nوَلَا قَطَعَ رَجَاۤئِيْ فِيْمَا تَوَقَّعْتُهٗ\nWA LAA QATA'A RAJAA'EE FEEMAA TAWAQQA'TUH\nand has not disappointed me as regards that which I have anticipated;\nبَلْ اَلْبَسَنِيْ عَافِيَتَهٗ وَاَفَادَنِيْ نِعْمَتَهٗ وَاٰتَانِيْ كَرَامَتَهُ.\nBAL ALBASANEE A'AFIYATAHOO WA AFAADANEE NI'MATAHOO WA AATAANEE KARAAMATAH\nrather, He has dressed me good health from Him, bestowed upon me with His grace, and granted me His honoring.",
    "Salutation at the Tomb\nOn entering the shrine, stand at the tomb and recite:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكُمْ اَئِمَّةَ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَسَادَةَ الْمُتَّقِيْنَ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKUM A'IMMATAL MU'MINEENA WA SAADATAL MUTTAQEEN\nPeace be upon you, O the Imams of the believers, the chiefs of the pious,\nوَكُبَرَاۤءَ الصِّدِّيْقِيْنَ وَاُمَرَاۤءَ الصَّالِحِيْنَ\nWA KUBARAA'AS SIDDEEQEENA WA UMARAA'AS SAALIHEEN\nthe heads of the truthful, the princes of the righteous,\nوَقَادَةَ الْمُحْسِنِيْنَ وَاَعْلَامَ الْمُهْتَدِيْنَ\nWA QAADATAL MUHSINEENA WA A'LAAMAL MUHTADEEN\nthe leaders of the good-doers, the epitomes of the truly guided ones,\nوَاَنْوَارَ الْعَارِفِيْنَ وَوَرَثَةَ الْاَنْبِيَاۤءِ\nWA ANWAARAL A'ARIFEENA WA WARATHATAL ANBIYAA'\nthe light for the cognizant, the inheritors of the Prophets,\nوَصَفْوَةَ الْاَوْصِيَاۤءِ وَشُمُوْسَ الْاَتْقِيَاۤءِ\nWA SAFWATAL AWSIYAA'I WA SHUMOOSAL ATQIYAA'\nthe choicest of the Prophet’s successors, the sunlight of the devout ones,\nوَبُدُوْرَ الْخُلَفَاۤءِ وَعِبَادَ الرَّحْمٰنِ\nWA BUDOORAL KHULAFAA'I WA I'BAADAR RAHMAAN\nthe full moons of the vicegerents (of the Prophets), the (true) servants of the All-beneficent,\nوَشُرَكَاۤءَ الْقُرْاٰنِ وَمَنْهَجَ الْاِيْمَانِ\nWA SHURAKAA'AL QUR'AANI WA MANHAJAL EEMAAN\nthe partners of the Qur’an, the course to the (true) faith,\nوَمَعَادِنَ الْحَقَاۤئِقِ وَشُفَعَاۤءَ الْخَلَاۤئِقِ\nWA MA'AADINAL HAQAA'IQI WA SHUFA'AA'AL KHALAA'IQ\nthe essences of the realities, and the interceders for the beings.\nوَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nWA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nAllah’s mercy and blessings be upon you.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكُمْ اَبْوَابُ اللّٰهِ\nASH-HADU ANNAKUM ABWAABULLAAH\nI bear witness that You are the doors to Allah,\nوَمَفَاتِيْحُ رَحْمَتِهٖ وَمَقَالِيْدُ مَغْفِرَتِهٖ\nWA MAFAATEEHU RAHMATIHEE WA MAQAALEEDU MAGHFIRATIH\nthe clues to (attaining) His mercy, the keys to His forgiveness,\nوَسَحَاۤئِبُ رِضْوَانِهٖ وَمَصَابِيْحُ جِنَانِهٖ\nWA SAHAA'IBU RIDWAANIHEE WA MASAABEEHU JINAANIH\nthe clouds of His pleasure, the lanterns of the gardens of His Paradise,\nوَحَمَلَةُ فُرْقَانِهٖ وَخَزَنَةُ عِلْمِهٖ\nWA HAMALATU FURQAANIHEE WA KHAZANATU I'LMIH\nthe carriers of His distinguishing Book, the hoarders of His knowledge,\nوَحَفَظَةُ سِرِّهٖ وَمَهْبِطُ وَحْيِهٖ\nWA HAFAZATU SIRRIHEE WA MAHBITU WAHYIH\nthe keepers of His secret, and the place of the descent of His revelation.\nوَعِنْدَكُمْ اَمَانَاتُ النُّبُوَّةِ وَوَدَاۤئِعُ الرِّسَالَةِ\nWA I'NDAKUM AMAANAATUN NUBUWWATI WA WADAA'I'UR RISAALAH\nThe trusts of prophethood are possessed by you. So are the charges of the Divine Message.\nاَنْتُمْ اُمَنَاۤءُ اللّٰهِ وَاَحِبَّاؤُهٗ وَعِبَادُهٗ وَاَصْفِيَاۤؤُهٗ\nANTUM UMANAA'ULLAAHI WA AHIBBAA'UHOO WA I'BAADUHOO WA ASFIYAA'UH\nYou are Allah’s trustees, well-beloved, servants, and choicest ones.\nوَاَنْصَارُ تَوْحِيْدِهٖ وَاَرْكَانُ تَمْجِيْدِهٖ\nWA ANSAARU TAWHEEDIHEE WA ARKAANU TAMJEEDIH\nYou are also the supporter of (the creed of) His Oneness, the pillars of glorifying Him,\nوَدُعَاتُهٗ اِلٰى كُتُبِهٖ\nWA DU'AATUHOO ILAA KUTUBIH\nthe callers to (the belief in) His Books,\nوَحَرَسَةُ خَلاۤئِقِهٖ وَحَفَظَةُ وَدَاۤئِعِهٖ\nWA HARASATU KHALAA'IQIHEE WA HAFAZATU WADAA'I'IH\nthe guardians over His beings, and the custodians of His trusts.\nلَا يَسْبِقُكُمْ ثَنَاۤءُ الْمَلَاۤئِكَةِ فِي الْاِخْلَاصِ وَالْخُشُوْعِ،\nLAA YASBIQUKUM THANAA'UL MALAA'IKATI FIL IKHLAASI WAL KHUSHOO'\nNeither the praising of the angels with all of its sincerity and reverence can precede Yours\nوَلَا يُضَآدُّكُمْ ذُوْ ابْتِهَالٍ وَخُضُوْعٍ\nWA LAA YUDAADDUKUM DHUB TIHAALIN WA KHUDOO'\nnor can any earnest suppliant and pious one compare himself to Yours.\nاَنّٰى وَلَكُمُ الْقُلُوْبُ الَّتِيْ تَوَلَّى اللّٰهُ رِيَاضَتَهَا بِالْخَوْفِ وَالرَّجَاۤءِ\nANNAA WA LAKUMUL QULOOBUL LATEE TAWALLALLAAHU RIYAADATAHAA BIL KHAWFI WAR RAJAA'\nHow can that be! While your hearts are these which Allah Himself has schooled with means of fear and hope for Him,\nوَجَعَلَهَا اَوْعِيَةً لِلشُّكْرِ وَالثَّنَاۤءِ\nWA JA'ALAHAA AW'IYATAN LISH SHUKRI WATH THANAA'\nmade containers of thanksgiving and praising Him,\nوَاٰمَنَهَا مِنْ عَوَارِضِ الْغَفْلَةِ وَصَفَّاهَا مِنْ سُوْۤءِ [شَوَاغِلِ‏] الْفَتْرَةِ\nWA AAMANAHAA MIN A'WAARIDIL GHAFLATI WA SAFFAAHAA MIN SOO'IL [SHAWAAGHILIL] FATRAH\nsecured against even accidental inattentiveness, and purified from the evil of languor.\nبَلْ يَتَقَرَّبُ اَهْلُ السَّمَاۤءِ بِحُبِّكُمْ وَبِالْبَرَاۤءَةِ مِنْ اَعْدَاۤئِكُمْ\nBAL YATAQARRABU AHLUS SAMAA'I BIHUBBIKUM WA BIL BARAA'ATI MIN A'DAA'IKUM\nMore exactly, the inhabitants of the heavens seek nearness [to Allah] through their love for you and disavowal of your enemies,\nوَتَوَاتُرِ الْبُكَاۤءِ عَلٰى مُصَابِكُمْ\nWA TAWAATURIL BUKAA'I A'LAA MUSAABIKUM\nand through persistent weeping for your misfortunes\nوَالْاِسْتِغْفَارِ لِشِيْعَتِكُمْ وَمُحِبِّيْكُمْ\nWAL ISTIGHFAARI LISHEE'ATIKUM WA MUHIBBEEKUM\nand imploring for Allah’s forgiveness for your adherents and supporters.\nفَاَنَا اُشْهِدُ اللّٰهَ خَالِقِيْ\nFA-ANAA USH-HIDULLAAHA KHAALIQEE\nI, hereby, ask Allah, my Creator, to witness for me,\nوَاُشْهِدُ مَلَاۤئِكَتَهٗ وَاَنْبِيَاۤءَهٗ\nWA USH-HIDU MALAA'IKATAHOO WA ANBIYAA'AH\nand I ask His angels and Prophets to witness for me, too\nوَاُشْهِدُكُمْ يَا مَوَالِيَّ\nWA USH-HIDUKUM YAA MAWAALIYY\nand I ask you, too, O my masters, to witness for me\nاَنِّيْ مُؤْمِنٌ بِوِلَايَتِكُمْ مُعْتَقِدٌ لِاِمَامَتِكُمْ\nANNEE MU'MINUN BIWILAAYATIKUM MU'TAQIDUN LI-IMAAMATIKUM\nthat I have full faith in your (divinely commissioned) leadership, I fully believe in your Imamate,\nمُقِرٌّ بِخِلَافَتِكُمْ عَارِفٌ بِمَنْزِلَتِكُمْ\nMUQIRRUN BIKHILAAFATIKUM A'ARIFUN BIMANZILATIKUM\nI confess of your successorship (to prophethood), I am aware of your unmatched rank,\nمُوْقِنٌ بِعِصْمَتِكُمْ خَاضِعٌ لِوِلَايَتِكُمْ،\nMOOQINUN BI-I'SMATIKUM KHAADI'UN LIWILAAYATIKUM\nI am certain of your infallibility, I submit to your leadership,\nمُتَقَرِّبٌ اِلَى اللّٰهِ بِحُبِّكُمْ وَبِالْبَرَاۤءَةِ مِنْ اَعْدَاۤئِكُمْ\nMUTAQARRIBUN ILALLAAHI BIHUBBIKUM WA BIL BARAA'ATI MIN A'DAA'IKUM\nI seek nearness to Allah through my love for you and disavowal of your enemies,\nعَالِمٌ بِاَنَّ اللّٰهَ قَدْ طَهَّرَكُمْ مِنَ الْفَوَاحِشِ مَا ظَهَرَ مِنْهَا وَمَا بَطَنَ\nA'ALIMUN BI-ANNALLAAHA QAD TAHHARAKUM MINAL FAWAAHISHI MAA ZAHARA MINHAA WA MAA BATAN\nI know for sure that Allah has purified you from indecencies, whether open or secret,\nوَمِنْ كُلِّ رِيْبَةٍ وَنَجَاسَةٍ وَدَنِيَّةٍ وَرَجَاسَةٍ\nWA MIN KULLI REEBATIN WA NAJAASATIN WA DANIYYATIN WA RAJAASAH\nand from all suspicions, filth, all ill deeds, and ignominy.\nوَمَنَحَكُمْ رَايَةَ الْحَقِّ الَّتِيْ مَنْ تَقَدَّمَهَا ضَلَّ وَمَنْ تَاَخَّرَ عَنْهَا زَلَّ\nWA MANAHAKUM RAAYATAL HAQQIL LATEE MAN TAQADDAMAHAA DALLA WA MAN TA'AKHKHARA A'NHAA ZALL\nAnd He has granted you the pennon of the truth that whoever foregoes shall have missed the right way and whoever lags behind shall have slipped.\nوَفَرَضَ طَاعَتَكُمْ عَلٰى كُلِّ اَسْوَدَ وَاَبْيَضَ\nWA FARADA TAA'ATAKUM A'LAA KULLI ASWADA WA ABYAD\nHe has imposed the obedience to you upon all beings, be them black or white.\nوَاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكُمْ قَدْ وَفَيْتُمْ بِعَهْدِ اللّٰهِ وَذِمَّتِهٖ\nWA ASH-HADU ANNAKUM QAD WAFAYTUM BI-A'HDILLAAHI WA DHIMMATIH\nI also bear witness that you have verily fulfilled your pledge and promise to Allah\nوَبِكُلِّ مَا اشْتَرَطَ [اشْتَرَطَهٗ‏] عَلَيْكُمْ فِيْ كِتَابِهٖ\nWA BIKULLI MASH TARATA [MASH TARATAHOO] A'LAYKUM FEE KITAABIH\nand carried out all that which He stipulated on you in His Book.\nوَدَعَوْتُمْ اِلٰى سَبِيْلِهٖ وَاَنْفَذْتُمْ طَاقَتَكُمْ فِيْ مَرْضَاتِهٖ\nWA DA'AWTUM ILAA SABEELIHEE WA ANFADHTUM TAAQATAKUM FEE MARDAATIH\nYou also called for (following) His Path, exerted all your efforts in seeking His pleasure,\nوَحَمَلْتُمُ الْخَلَاۤئِقَ عَلٰى مِنْهَاجِ النُّبُوَّةِ وَمَسَالِكِ الرِّسَالَةِ\nWA HAMALTUMUL KHALAA'IQA A'LAA MINHAAJIN NUBUWWATI WA MASAALIKIR RISAALAH\nled the beings to the course of Prophethood and the paths of the Divine Message,\nوَسِرْتُمْ فِيْهِ بِسِيْرَةِ الْاَنْبِيَاۤءِ وَمَذَاهِبِ الْاَوْصِيَاۤءِ\nWA SIRTUM FEEHI BISEERATIL ANBIYAA'I WA MADHAAHIBIL AWSIYAA'\nand dealt with them according to the norm of the Prophets and the customs of the Prophets’ successors.\nفَلَمْ يُطَعْ لَكُمْ اَمْرٌ وَلَمْ تُصْغَ اِلَيْكُمْ اُذُنٌ\nFALAM YUTA' LAKUM AMRUN WA LAM TUSGHA ILAYKUM UDHUN\nNonetheless, none of your instructions was carried out, and none lent you any ear.\nفَصَلَوَاتُ اللّٰهِ عَلٰۤى اَرْوَاحِكُمْ وَاَجْسَادِكُمْ.\nFASALAWAATULLAAHI A'LAA ARWAAHIKUM WA AJSAADIKUM\nSo, Allah’s blessings be upon your souls and your bodies.",
    "Embracing the Tomb\nEmbrace the tomb and recite:\nبِاَبِيْۤ اَنْتَ وَاُمِّيْ يَا حُجَّةَ اللّٰهِ\nBI-ABEE ANTA WA UMMEE YAA HUJJATALLAAH\nMay Allah accept my father and mother as ransoms for you, O Argument of Allah.\nلَقَدْ اُرْضِعْتَ بِثَدْيِ الْاِيْمَانِ وَفُطِمْتَ بِنُوْرِ الْاِسْلَامِ\nLAQAD URDI'TA BITHADYIL EEMAANI WA FUTIMTA BINOORIL ISLAAM\nYou were certainly fed by the breast of faith, weaned on the illumination of Islam,\nوَغُذِّيْتَ بِبَرْدِ الْيَقِيْنِ وَاُلْبِسْتَ حُلَلَ الْعِصْمَةِ\nWA GHUDHDHEETA BIBARDIL YAQEENI WA ULBISTA HULALAL I'SMAH\nnourished on the utter certitude, dressed the garments of infallibility,\nوَاصْطُفِيْتَ وَوُرِّثْتَ عِلْمَ الْكِتَابِ وَلُقِّنْتَ فَصْلَ الْخِطَابِ\nWASTUFEETA WA WURRITHTA I'LMAL KITAABI WA LUQQINTA FASLAL KHITAAB\nchosen and inherited the knowledge of the Book, and prompted the decisive speech.\nوَاُوْضِحَ بِمَكَانِكَ مَعَارِفُ التَّنْزِيْلِ وَغَوَامِضُ التَّاْوِيْلِ\nWA OODIHA BIMAKAANIKA MA'AARIFUT TANZEELI WA GHAWAAMIDUT TA'WEEL\nThrough your position were the knowledge of the Divine Revelation and the mysteries of the interpretation (of the Qur’an) made clear.\nوَسُلِّمَتْ اِلَيْكَ رَايَةُ الْحَقِّ\nWA SULLIMAT ILAYKA RAAYATUL HAQQ\nTo you was the pennon of the truth delivered.\nوَكُلِّفْتَ هِدَايَةَ الْخَلْقِ\nWA KULLIFTA HIDAAYATAL KHALQ\nYou were charged with guiding the beings.\nوَنُبِذَ اِلَيْكَ عَهْدُ الْاِمَامَةِ\nWA NUBIDHA ILAYKA A'HDUL IMAAMAH\nTo you was the pledge of Imamate given exclusively.\nوَاُلْزِمْتَ حِفْظَ الشَّرِيْعَةِ\nWA ULZIMTA HIFZASH SHAREE'AH\nYou were assigned to preserve the religious law.\nوَاَشْهَدُ يَا مَوْلَايَ اَنَّكَ وَفَيْتَ بِشَرَاۤئِطِ الْوَصِيَّةِ\nWA ASH-HADU YAA MAWLAAYA ANNAKA WAFAYTA BISHARAA'ITIL WASIYYAH\nI also bear witness, O my master, that you met all the qualifications of successorship,\nوَقَضَيْتَ مَا لَزِمَكَ مِنْ حَدِّ الطَّاعَةِ\nWA QADAYTA MAA LAZIMAKA MIN HADDIT TAA'AH\nsettled all your obligations as regards the obedience (to Allah),\nوَنَهَضْتَ بِاَعْبَاۤءِ الْاِمَامَةِ\nWA NAHADTA BI-A'BAA'IL IMAAMAH\ncarried successfully all the burdens of Imamate,\nوَاحْتَذَيْتَ مِثَالَ النُّبُوَّةِ فِيْ الصَّبْرِ وَالْاِجْتِهَادِ\nWAHTADHAYTA MITHAALAN NUBUWWATI FIS SABRI WAL IJTIHAAD\nand followed the example of prophethood in endurance, exertion of all possible efforts,\nوَالنَّصِيْحَةِ لِلْعِبَادِ وَكَظْمِ الْغَيْظِ وَالْعَفْوِ عَنِ النَّاسِ\nWAN NASEEHATI LIL I'BAADI WA KAZMIL GHAYZI WAL A'FWI A'NIN NAAS\ngiving advice to the servants, suppressing your rage, and pardoning the people.\nوَعَزَمْتَ عَلَى الْعَدْلِ فِي الْبَرِيَّةِ وَالنَّصَفَةِ فِيْ الْقَضِيَّةِ\nWA A'ZAMTA A'LAL A'DLI FIL BARIYYATI WAN NASAFATI FIL QADIYYAH\nYou were also determined to act fairly with the creatures and to be just in all issues.\nوَوَكَّدْتَ الْحُجَجَ عَلَى الْاُمَّةِ بِالدَّلَاۤئِلِ الصَّادِقَةِ وَالشَّرِيْعَةِ النَّاطِقَةِ،\nWA WAKKADTAL HUJAJA A'LAL UMMATI BID DALAA'ILIS SAADIQATI WASH SHAREE'ATIN NAATIQAH\nYou confirmed all the claims (of Allah) on the community through irrefutable proofs and through the speaking law\nوَدَعَوْتَ اِلَى اللّٰهِ بِالْحِكْمَةِ الْبَالِغَةِ وَالْمَوْعِظَةِ الْحَسَنَةِ\nWA DA'AWTA ILALLAAHI BIL HIKMATIL BAALIGHATI WAL MAW'IZATIL HASANAH\nand called to the way of Allah with wisdom and fair exhortation.\nفَمُنِعْتَ مِنْ تَقْوِيْمِ الزَّيْغِ وَسَدِّ الثُّلَمِ\nFAMUNI'TA MIN TAQWEEMIZ ZAYGHI WA SADDITH THULAM\nBut you were prevented from straightening the deviation, closing the breaches,\nوَاِصْلَاحِ الْفَاسِدِ وَكَسْرِ الْمُعَانِدِ\nWA ISLAAHIL FAASIDI WA KASRIL MU'AANID\nmending the wrong, beating the stubborn evildoer,\nوَاِحْيَاۤءِ السُّنَنِ وَاِمَاتَةِ الْبِدَعِ\nWA IHYAA'IS SUNANI WA IMAATATIL BIDA'\nreviving the norms (of the Prophets), and annihilating the heresies\nحَتّٰى فَارَقْتَ الدُّنْيَا وَاَنْتَ شَهِيْدٌ\nHATTAA FAARAQTAD DUNYAA WA ANTA SHAHEED\nuntil you departed this life as martyr\nوَلَقِيْتَ رَسُوْلَ اللّٰهِ صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهِ وَاَنْتَ حَمِيْدٌ\nWA LAQEETA RASOOLALLAAHI SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIHEE WA ANTA HAMEED\nand met the Messenger of Allah, peace be upon him and his Household, as praiseworthy.\nصَلَوَاتُ اللّٰهِ عَلَيْكَ تَتَرَادَفُ وَتَزِيْدُ.\nSALAWAATULLAAHI A'LAYKA TATARAADAFU WA TAZEED\nMay the blessings of Allah continue on you incessantly and increasingly.",
    "At the Feet\nMove to the side of the feet and recite:\nيَا سَادَتِيْ يَاۤ اٰلَ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nYAA SAADATEE YAA AALA RASOOLILLAAH\nO my masters! O Household of Allah’s Messenger!\nاِنِّيْ بِكُمْ اَتَقَرَّبُ اِلَى اللّٰهِ جَلَّ وَعَلَا\nINNEE BIKUM ATAQARRABU ILALLAAHI JALLA WA A'LAA\nIn your names do I seek nearness to Allah the All-majestic and All-elevated\nبِالْخِلَافِ عَلَى الَّذِيْنَ غَدَرُوْا بِكُمْ\nBIL KHILAAFI A'LAL LADHEENA GHADAROO BIKUM\nby dissenting from those who betrayed you,\nوَنَكَثُوْا بَيْعَتَكُمْ وَجَحَدُوْا وِلَايَتَكُمْ\nWA NAKATHOO BAY'ATAKUM WA JAHADOO WILAAYATAKUM\nbreached their allegiance to you, denied your leadership,\nوَاَنْكَرُوْا مَنْزِلَتَكُمْ وَخَلَعُوْا رِبْقَةَ طَاعَتِكُمْ\nWA ANKAROO MANZILATAKUM WA KHALA'OO RIBQATA TAA'ATIKUM\nrenounced your position, gave up their obedience to you,\nوَهَجَرُوْۤا اَسْبَابَ مَوَدَّتِكُمْ\nWA HAJAROO ASBAABA MAWADDATIKUM\nabandoned the love for you,\nوَتَقَرَّبُوْۤا اِلٰى فَرَاعِنَتِهِمْ بِالْبَرَاۤءَةِ مِنْكُمْ وَالْاِعْرَاضِ عَنْكُمْ\nWA TAQARRABOO ILAA FARAA'INATIHIM BIL BARAA'ATI MINKUM WAL I'RAADI A'NKUM\ncurried favor with their tyrant rulers through disavowing and rejecting you,\nوَمَنَعُوْكُمْ مِنْ اِقَامَةِ الْحُدُوْدِ وَاسْتِيْصَالِ الْجُحُوْدِ\nWA MANA'OOKUM MIN IQAAMATIL HUDOODI WASTEESAALIL JUHOOD\nprevented you from carrying out the religious laws, eradicating atheism,\nوَشَعْبِ الصَّدْعِ وَلَمِّ الشَّعَثِ وَسَدِّ الْخَلَلِ\nWA SHA'BIS SAD'I WA LAMMISH SHA'ATHI WA SADDIL KHALAL\nsetting right the split, rejoining the scattered, meeting the deficiency,\nوَتَثْقِيْفِ الْاَوَدِ وَاِمْضَاۤءِ الْاَحْكَامِ\nWA TATHQEEFIL AWADI WA IMDAA'IL AHKAAM\nstraightening the crookedness, executing the divine laws,\nوَتَهْذِيْبِ الْاِسْلَامِ وَقَمْعِ الْاٰثَامِ\nWA TAHDHEEBIL ISLAAMI WA QAM'IL AATHAAM\nrefining Islam, and restraining sins;\nوَاَرْهَجُوْا عَلَيْكُمْ نَقْعَ الْحُرُوْبِ وَالْفِتَنِ\nWA ARHAJOO A'LAYKUM NAQ'AL HUROOBI WAL FITAN\nthey stirred up the dust of wars and seditions against you,\nوَاَنْحَوْا عَلَيْكُمْ سُيُوْفَ الْاَحْقَادِ\nWA ANHAW A'LAYKUM SUYOOFAL AHQAAD\nunsheathed the swords of malice against you,\nوَهَتَكُوْا مِنْكُمُ السُّتُوْرَ وَابْتَاعُوْا بِخُمْسِكُمُ الْخُمُوْرَ\nWA HATAKOO MINKUMUS SUTOORA WABTAA'OO BIKHUMSIKUMUL KHUMOOR\nrent your coverings, bought wines with the khumus levy that is decided for you exclusively,\nوَصَرَفُوْا صَدَقَاتِ الْمَسَاكِيْنِ اِلَى الْمُضْحِكِيْنَ وَالسَّاخِرِيْنَ\nWA SARAFOO SADAQAATIL MASAAKEENI ILAL MUD-HIKEENA WAS SAAKHIREEN\nand paid the alms that are decided for the poor to the clowns and jokers.\nوَذٰلِكَ بِمَا طَرَّقَتْ لَهُمُ الْفَسَقَةُ الْغُوَاةُ، وَالْحَسَدَةُ الْبُغَاةُ\nWA DHAALIKA BIMAA TARRAQAT LAHUMUL FASAQATUL GHUWAATU WAL HASADATUL BUGHAAH\nAll that was because of the urging practices of the licentious, the aberrant, the envious, and the oppressors;\nاَهْلُ النَّكْثِ وَالْغَدْرِ وَالْخِلَافِ وَالْمَكْرِ\nAHLUN NAKTHI WAL GHADRI WAL KHILAAFI WAL MAKR\nthe people of breach, treachery, rebellion, and deceit;\nوَالْقُلُوْبِ الْمُنْتِنَةِ مِنْ قَذَرِ الشِّرْكِ\nWAL QULOOBIL MUNTINATI MIN QADHARISH SHIRK\nwhose hearts are evil-smelling due to the filth of polytheism,\nوَالْاَجْسَادِ الْمُشْحَنَةِ مِنْ دَرَنِ الْكُفْرِ\nWAL AJSAADIL MUSH-HANATI MIN DARANIL KUFR\nand whose bodies are suffocated with the dirt of atheism.\nالَّذِيْنَ اَضَبُّوْا عَلَى النِّفَاقِ وَاَكَبُّوْا عَلٰى عَلَاۤئِقِ الشِّقَاقِ\nALLADHEENA ADABBOO A'LAN NIFAAQI WA AKABBOO A'LAA A'LAA'IQISH SHIQAAQ\nIt is they who embraced hypocrisy and buckled down to dissension.\nفَلَمَّا مَضَى الْمُصْطَفٰى صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهِ\nFALAMMAA MADAL MUSTAFAA SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIH\nSo, when the Chosen Prophet, Allah’s peace be upon him and his Household, passed away,\nاخْتَطَفُوْا الْغِرَّةَ وَانْتَهَزُوْا الْفُرْصَةَ\nIKHTATAFUL GHIRRATA WANTAHAZUL FURSAH\nthey seized the opportunity, took the occasion,\nوَانْتَهَكُوْا الْحُرْمَةَ وَغَادَرُوْهُ عَلٰى فِرَاشِ الْوَفَاةِ\nWANTAHAKUL HURMATA WA GHAADAROOHU A'LAA FIRAASHIL WAFAAH\nand violated the sanctity. They left him bedridden\nوَاَسْرَعُوْا لِنَقْضِ الْبَيْعَةِ وَمُخَالَفَةِ الْمَوَاثِيْقِ الْمُؤَكَّدَةِ\nWA ASRA'OO LINAQDIL BAY'ATI WA MUKHAALAFATIL MAWAATHEEQIL MU'AKKADAH\nand hurried to breach their allegiance, break the covenants that had been confirmedly taken from them,\nوَخِيَانَةِ الْاَمَانَةِ الْمَعْرُوْضَةِ عَلَى الْجِبَالِ الرَّاسِيَةِ وَاَبَتْ اَنْ تَحْمِلَهَا\nWA KHIYAANATIL AMAANATIL MA'ROODATI A'LAL JIBAALIR RAASIYATI WA ABAT AN TAHMILAHAA\nbetray the Trust that had been offered to the unshakable mountains but they (i.e. the mountains) refused to undergo;\nوَحَمَلَهَا الْاِنْسَانُ الظَّلُوْمُ الْجَهُوْلُ\nWA HAMALAHAL INSAANUZ ZALOOMUL JAHOOL\nrather, man, the wronging and ignorant, accepted to assume it.\nذُوْ الشِّقَاقِ وَالْعِزَّةِ بِالْاٰثَامِ الْمُوْلِمَةِ\nDHUSH SHIQAAQI WAL I'ZZATI BIL AATHAAMIL MOOLIMAH\nMan is actually dissenting, obstinate to committing grave sins,\nوَالْاَنَفَةِ عَنِ الْاِنْقِيَادِ لِحَمِيْدِ الْعَاقِبَةِ،\nWAL ANAFATI A'NIL INQIYAADI LIHAMEEDIL A'AQIBAH\nand disdaining from submission to that whose end result is praiseworthy.\nفَحُشِرَ سِفْلَةُ الْاَعْرَابِ وَبَقَايَا الْاَحْزَابِ\nFAHUSHIRA SIFLATUL A'RAABI WA BAQAAYAL AHZAAB\nHence, the lowly Bedouins and the rest of the parties (who had allied each other against the Holy Prophet) were gathered\nاِلٰى دَارِ النُّبُوَّةِ وَالرِّسَالَةِ وَمَهْبِطِ الْوَحْيِ وَالْمَلَاۤئِكَةِ\nILAA DAARIN NUBUWWATI WAR RISAALATI WA MAHBITIL WAHYI WAL MALAA'IKAH\nto the abode of the prophethood, Divine Message, Divine Revelation and angels,\nوَمُسْتَقَرِّ سُلْطَانِ الْوِلَايَةِ\nWA MUSTAQARRI SULTAANIL WILAAYAH\nthe center of the authority of the (divinely commissioned) leadership (of the Holy Imams),\nوَمَعْدِنِ الْوَصِيَّةِ وَالْخِلَافَةِ وَالْاِمَامَةِ\nWA MA'DINIL WASIYYATI WAL KHILAAFATI WAL IMAAMAH\nand the core of the Prophet’s successorship, inheritance, and Imamate.\nحَتّٰى نَقَضُوْا عَهْدَ الْمُصْطَفٰى فِيْۤ اَخِيْهِ\nHATTAA NAQADOO A'HDAL MUSTAFAA FEE AKHEEH\nThey therefore breached the covenant (that they had made) to the Chosen Prophet as regards the leadership of his brother,\nعَلَمِ الْهُدٰى وَالْمُبَيِّنِ طَرِيْقَ النَّجَاةِ مِنْ طُرُقِ الرَّدٰى\nA'LAMIL HUDAA WAL MUBAYYINI TAREEQAN NAJAATI MIN TURUQIR RADAA\nthe sign of true guidance (namely, Imam 'Ali) who alone can distinguish the path of salvation from these of perdition,\nوَجَرَحُوْا كَبِدَ خَيْرِ الْوَرٰى فِيْ ظُلْمِ ابْنَتِهٖ\nWA JARAHOO KABIDA KHAYRIL WARAA FEE ZULMIB NATIH\nand they injured the heart of the best of beings (namely, the Holy Prophet) when they oppressed and wronged his daughter;\nوَاضْطِهَادِ حَبِيْبَتِهٖ وَاهْتِضَامِ عَزِيْزَتِهٖ\nWADTIHAADI HABEEBATIHEE WAHTIDAAMI A'ZEEZATIH\nthe much-loved one to him, aggrieved his dearest one;\nبِضْعَةِ لَحْمِهٖ وَفِلْذَةِ كَبِدِهٖ\nBID'ATI LAHMIHEE WA FILDHATI KABIDIH\nthe part of his flesh and the piece of his heart,\nوَخَذَلُوْا بَعْلَهَا وَصَغَّرُوْا قَدْرَهٗ\nWA KHADHALOO BA'LAHAA WA SAGHGHAROO QADRAH\ndisappointed her husband, belittled him,\nوَاسْتَحَلُّوْا مَحَارِمَهٗ وَقَطَعُوْا رَحِمَهٗ\nWASTAHALLOO MAHAARIMAHOO WA QATA'OO RAHIMAH\nviolated his sanctities, ruptured relations of kinship with him,\nوَاَنْكَرُوْۤا اُخُوَّتَهٗ وَهَجَرُوْا مَوَدَّتَهٗ\nWA ANKAROO UKHUWWATAHOO WA HAJAROO MAWADDATAH\ndenied his fraternity (with the Holy Prophet), neglected his love for him,\nوَنَقَضُوْا طَاعَتَهٗ وَجَحَدُوْا وِلَايَتَهٗ،\nWA NAQADOO TAA'ATAHOO WA JAHADOO WILAAYATAH\ndefied their (obligatory) obedience to him, denied his leadership (over them),\nوَاَطْمَعُوْا الْعَبِيْدَ فِيْ خِلَافَتِهٖ\nWA ATMA'UL A'BEEDA FEE KHILAAFATIH\ngave even the slaves the opportunity to seize his position of leadership,\nوَقَادُوْهُ اِلٰى بَيْعَتِهِمْ مُصْلِتَةً سُيُوْفَهَا مُقْذِعَةً [مُشْرِعَةً] اَسِنَّتَهَا\nWA QAADOOHU ILAA BAY'ATIHIM MUSLITATAN SUYOOFAHAA MUQDHI'ATAN [MUSHRI'ATAN] ASINNATAHAA\nand led him to swear allegiance to them under unsheathed swords and directed spears\nوَهُوَ سَاخِطُ الْقَلْبِ هَاۤئِجُ الْغَضَبِ شَدِيْدُ الصَّبْرِ كَاظِمُ الْغَيْظِ\nWA HUWA SAAKHITUL QALBI HAA'IJUL GHADABI SHADEEDUS SABRI KAAZIMUL GHAYZ\nwhile he was extremely irritated and enormously wrathful, but very patient and self-possessed.\nيَدْعُوْنَهٗ اِلٰى بَيْعَتِهِمُ الَّتِيْ عَمَّ شُؤْمُهَا الْاِسْلَامَ\nYAD'OONAHOO ILAA BAY'ATIHIMUL LATEE A'MMA SHU'MUHAL ISLAAM\nThey were asking him to swear allegiance to their rulership whose misfortune prevailed in Islam absolutely\nوَزَرَعَتْ فِيْ قُلُوْبِ اَهْلِهَا الْاٰثَامَ\nWA ZARA'AT FEE QULOOBI AHLIHAL AATHAAM\nand planted sins in the hearts of the Muslims.\nوَعَقَّتْ [وَعَنَّفَتْ‏] سَلْمَانَهَا وَطَرَدَتْ مِقْدَادَهَا\nWA A'QQAT [WA A'NNAFAT] SALMAANAHAA WA TARADAT MIQDAADAHAA\nThey therefore acted insubordinately towards Salman, banished al-Miqdad,\nوَنَفَتْ جُنْدُبَهَا وَفَتَقَتْ بَطْنَ عَمَّارِهَا\nWA NAFAT JUNDUBAHAA WA FATAQAT BATNA A'MMAARIHAA\nexiled Jundub, tore the abdomen of 'Ammar,\nوَحَرَّفَتِ الْقُرْاٰنَ وَبَدَّلَتِ الْاَحْكَامَ\nWA HARRAFATIL QUR'AANA WA BADDALATIL AHKAAM\ndistorted the (true interpretation of the) Qur’an, misrepresented the religious laws,\nوَغَيَّرَتِ الْمَقَامَ وَاَبَاحَتِ الْخُمْسَ لِلطُّلَقَاۤءِ\nWA GHAYYARATIL MAQAAMA WA ABAAHATIL KHUMSA LIT TULAQAA'\nchanged the place of al-maqam, gave free hand to the Released Ones to dispose of the khumus tax,\nوَسَلَّطَتْ اَوْلَادَ اللُّعَنَاۤءِ عَلَى الْفُرُوْجِ وَالدِّمَاۤءِ\nWA SALLATAT AWLAADAL LU'ANAA'I A'LAL FUROOJI WAD DIMAA'\nset up the descendants of the accursed ones as absolute rulers over the honors and blood (of Muslims),\nوَخَلَطَتِ الْحَلَالَ بِالْحَرَامِ وَاسْتَخَفَّتْ بِالْاِيْمَانِ وَالْاِسْلَامِ\nWA KHALATATIL HALAALA BIL HARAAMI WASTAKHAFFAT BIL EEMAANI WAL ISLAAM\nintermixed the lawful with the unlawful, belittled faith and Islam,\nوَهَدَمَتِ الْكَعْبَةَ،\nWA HADAMATIL KA'BAH\ndemolished the (Holy) Ka'bah,\nوَاَغَارَتْ عَلٰى دَارِ الْهِجْرَةِ يَوْمَ الْحَرَّةِ\nWA AGHAARAT A'LAA DAARIL HIJRATI YAWMAL HARRAH\nraided the abode of the (Holy Prophet’s) immigration on the day of al-Harrah Raid,\nوَاَبْرَزَتْ بَنَاتِ الْمُهَاجِرِيْنَ وَالْاَنْصَارِ لِلنَّكَالِ وَالسَّوْرَةِ [وَالسَّوْءَةِ]\nWA ABRAZAT BANAATIL MUHAAJIREENA WAL ANSAARI LIN NAKAALI WAS SAWRATI [WAS SAW'AH]\nsubjected the daughters of the Emigrants and the Supporters to punishment and humiliation,\nوَاَلْبَسَتْهُنَّ ثَوْبَ الْعَارِ وَالْفَضِيْحَةِ\nWA ALBASAT-HUNNA THAWBAL A'ARI WAL FADEEHAH\ncaused them to dress the garments of disgrace and scandal,\nوَرَخَّصَتْ لِاَهْلِ الشُّبْهَةِ فِيْ قَتْلِ اَهْلِ بَيْتِ الصَّفْوَةِ\nWA RAKHKHASAT LI-AHLISH SHUBHATI FEE QATLI AHLI BAYTIS SAFWAH\nand allowed the suspicious people to massacre the choice Household (of the Holy Prophet),\nوَاِبَادَةِ نَسْلِهٖ وَاسْتِيْصَالِ شَاْفَتِهٖ\nWA IBAADATI NASLIHEE WASTEESAALI SHA'FATIH\nto eradicate his (i.e. the Holy Prophet) offspring, to eliminate his progeny,\nوَسَبْيِ حَرَمِهٖ وَقَتْلِ اَنْصَارِهٖ\nWA SABYI HARAMIHEE WA QATLI ANSAARIH\nto capture his harem, to kill his supporters,\nوَكَسْرِ مِنْبَرِهٖ وَقَلْبِ مَفْخَرِهٖ\nWA KASRI MINBARIHEE WA QALBI MAFKHARIH\nto destroy his minbar, to turn over his object of pride,\nوَاِخْفَاۤءِ دِيْنِهٖ وَقَطْعِ ذِكْرِهٖ\nWA IKHFAA'I DEENIHEE WA QAT'I DHIKRIH\nto conceal his religion, and to cut off his mention.\nيَا مَوَالِيَّ فَلَوْ عَايَنَكُمُ الْمُصْطَفٰى\nYAA MAWAALIYYA FALAW A'AYANAKUMUL MUSTAFAA\nO my masters, had the Chosen Prophet seen\nوَسِهَامُ الْاُمَّةِ مُغْرَقَةٌ فِيْۤ اَكْبَادِكُمْ\nWA SIHAAMUL UMMATI MUGHRAQATUN FEE AKBAADIKUM\nhow the lances of the community (of him) were infixed in your hearts,\nوَرِمَاحُهُمْ مُشْرَعَةٌ فِيْ نُحُوْرِكُمْ\nWA RIMAAHUHUM MUSHRA'ATUN FEE NUHOORIKUM\nhow their spears were inserted into your throats,\nوَسُيُوْفُهَا مُوْلَغَةٌ فِيْ دِمَاۤئِكُمْ\nWA SUYOOFUHAA MOOLAGHATUN FEE DIMAA'IKUM\nand how their swords are covered with your blood,\nيَشْفِيْۤ اَبْنَاۤءُ الْعَوَاهِرِ غَلِيْلَ الْفِسْقِ مِنْ وَرَعِكُمْ\nYASHFEE ABNAA'UL A'WAAHIRI GHALEELAL FISQI MIN WARA'IKUM\nwhile the sons of whores were quenching their thirst of licentiousness from your godliness,\nوَغَيْظَ الْكُفْرِ مِنْ اِيْمَانِكُمْ،\nWA GHAYZAL KUFRI MIN EEMAANIKUM\ntheir thirst of atheism from your faith,\nوَاَنْتُمْ بَيْنَ صَرِيْعٍ فِي الْمِحْرَابِ قَدْ فَلَقَ السَّيْفُ هَامَتَهٗ\nWA ANTUM BAYNA SAREE'IN FIL MIHRAABI QAD FALAQAS SAYFU HAAMATAH\nand one of you was thrown down in the niche while his head is split by sword,\nوَشَهِيْدٍ فَوْقَ الْجِنَازَةِ قَدْ شُكَّتْ اَكْفَانُهٗ بِالسِّهَامِ\nWA SHAHEEDIN FAWQAL JINAAZATI QAD SHUKKAT AKFAANUHOO BIS SIHAAM\nanother one was martyred and during his funeral procession arrows heavily stuck his coffin,\nوَقَتِيْلٍ بِالْعَرَاۤءِ قَدْ رُفِعَ فَوْقَ الْقَنَاةِ رَاْسُهٗ\nWA QATEELIN BIL A'RAA'I QAD RUFI'A FAWQAL QANAATI RA'SUH\nanother one was slain and his body was left in the wasteland while his head was raised on a spearhead,\nوَمُكَبَّلٍ فِيْ السِّجْنِ قَدْ رُضَّتْ بِالْحَدِيْدِ اَعْضَاۤؤُهٗ\nWA MUKABBALIN FIS SIJNI QAD RUDDAT BIL HADEEDI A'DAA'UH\nanother one was enchained in the prison while fetters crushed his limbs,\nوَمَسْمُوْمٍ قَدْ قُطِّعَتْ بِجُرَعِ السَّمِّ اَمْعَاۤؤُهٗ\nWA MASMOOMIN QAD QUTTI'AT BIJURA'IS SAMMI AM'AA'UH\nanother one was poisoned and poison cut his intestine into parts,\nوَشَمْلُكُمْ عَبَادِيْدُ تُفْنِيْهِمُ الْعَبِيْدُ وَاَبْنَاۤءُ الْعَبِيْدِ\nWA SHAMLUKUM A'BAADEEDU TUFNEEHIMUL A'BEEDU WA ABNAA'UL A'BEED\nand your people are thus scattered; they were terminated by the slaves and the slaves’ sons!\nفَهَلِ الْمِحَنُ يَا سَادَتِيْ اِلَّا الَّتِيْ لَزِمَتْكُمْ\nFAHALIL MIHANU YAA SAADATEE ILLAL LATEE LAZIMATKUM\nAre ordeals other than those which escorted you?\nوَالْمَصَاۤئِبُ اِلَّا الَّتِيْ عَمَّتْكُمْ\nWAL MASAA'IBU ILLAL LATEE A'MMATKUM\nAre misfortunes other than those which afflicted you?\nوَالْفَجَاۤئِعُ اِلَّا الَّتِيْ خَصَّتْكُمْ\nWAL FAJAA'I'U ILLAL LATEE KHASSATKUM\nAre catastrophes other than those which affected you?\nوَالْقَوَارِعُ اِلَّا الَّتِيْ طَرَقَتْكُمْ\nWAL QAWAARI'U ILLAL LATEE TARAQATKUM\nAre disasters other than those which distressed you?\nصَلَوَاتُ اللّٰهِ عَلَيْكُمْ وَعَلٰۤى اَرْوَاحِكُمْ وَاَجْسَادِكُمْ\nSALAWAATULLAAHI A'LAYKUM WA A'LAA ARWAAHIKUM WA AJSAADIKUM\nAllah’s blessings be upon you and upon your souls and your bodies.\nوَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهُ.\nWA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nAllah’s mercy and blessings be upon you.",
    "Kissing the Tomb\nKiss the tomb and recite:\nبِاَبِيْۤ اَنْتُمْ وَاُمِّيْ يَا اٰلَ الْمُصْطَفٰىۤ\nBI-ABEE ANTUM WA UMMEE YAA AALAL MUSTAFAA\nMay Allah accept my father and mother as ransoms for you, O Household of the Chosen Prophet.\nاِنَّا لَا نَمْلِكُ اِلَّا اَنْ نَطُوْفَ حَوْلَ مَشَاهِدِكُمْ\nINNAA LAA NAMLIKU ILLAA AN NATOOFA HAWLA MASHAAHIDIKUM\nWe have nothing to do more than circumambulating your shrines\nوَنُعَزِّيَ فِيْهَاۤ اَرْوَاحَكُمْ\nWA NU'AZZIYA FEEHAA ARWAAHAKUM\nso as to console your souls\nعَلٰى هٰذِهِ الْمَصَاۤئِبِ الْعَظِيْمَةِ الْحَآلَّةِ بِفِنَاۤئِكُمْ\nA'LAA HAADHIHIL MASAA'IBIL A'ZEEMATIL HAALLATI BIFINAA'IKUM\nfor such grave misfortunes that afflicted you\nوَالرَّزَايَا الْجَلِيْلَةِ النَّازِلَةِ بِسَاحَتِكُمُ\nWAR RAZAAYAL JALEELATIN NAAZILATI BISAAHATIKUM\nand unbearable hardships that distressed you;\nالَّتِيْۤ اَثْبَتَتْ فِيْ قُلُوْبِ شِيْعَتِكُمُ الْقُرُوْحَ\nALLATEE ATHBATAT FEE QULOOBI SHEE'ATIKUMUL QUROOH\nsuch hardships that fixed wounds in the hearts of your adherents,\nوَاَوْرَثَتْ اَكْبَادَهُمُ الْجُرُوْحَ\nWA AWRATHAT AKBAADAHUMUL JUROOH\ninstalled injuries in their interiors,\nوَزَرَعَتْ فِيْ صُدُوْرِهِمُ الْغُصَصَ\nWA ZARA'AT FEE SUDOORIHIMUL GHUSAS\nand implanted pains in their chests.\nفَنَحْنُ نُشْهِدُ اللّٰهَ اَنَّا قَدْ شَارَكْنَا اَوْلِيَاۤءَكُمْ وَاَنْصَارَكُمُ الْمُتَقَدِّمِيْنَ\nFANAHNU NUSH-HIDULLAAHA ANNAA QAD SHAARAKNAA AWLIYAA'AKUM WA ANSAARAKUMUL MUTAQADDIMEEN\nSo, we ask Allah to witness for us that we have participated with your allies and supporters who passed in time,\nفِيْۤ اِرَاقَةِ دِمَاۤءِ النَّاكِثِيْنَ وَالْقَاسِطِيْنَ وَالْمَارِقِيْنَ\nFEE IRAAQATI DIMAA'IN NAAKITHEENA WAL QAASITEENA WAL MAARIQEEN\nin the bloodshed of the breachers, the wrongdoers, and the apostates\nوَقَتَلَةِ اَبِيْ عَبْدِ اللّٰهِ سَيِّدِ شَبَابِ اَهْلِ الْجَنَّةِ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ يَوْمَ كَرْبَلَاۤءَ\nWA QATALATI ABEE A'BDILLAAHI SAYYIDI SHABAABI AHLIL JANNATI A'LAYHIS SALAAMU YAWMA KARBALAA'\nand of those who slew Abu-'Abdullah the chief of the youth of Paradise, peace be upon him on that day in Karbala'\nبِالنِّيَّاتِ وَالْقُلُوْبِ وَالتَّاَسُّفِ عَلٰى فَوْتِ تِلْكَ الْمَوَاقِفِ الَّتِيْ حَضَرُوْا لِنُصْرَتِكُمْ\nBIN NIYYAATI WAL QULOOBI WAT TA'ASSUFI A'LAA FAWTI TILKAL MAWAAQIFIL LATEE HADAROO LINUSRATIKUM\nyet in intentions and hearts and in feeling sorry for missing these situations that your allies and supporters witnessed and backed you.\nوَعَلَيْكُمْ مِنَّا السَّلَامُ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهُ.\nWA A'LAYKUM MINNAS SALAAMU WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nPeace from us be upon you. Allah’s mercy and blessings, too, be upon you.",
    "Between the Tomb and Qiblah\nStand between the tomb and the qiblah and recite:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ يَا ذَا الْقُدْرَةِ الَّتِيْ صَدَرَ عَنْهَا الْعَالَمُ\nALLAAHUMMA YAA DHAL QUDRATIL LATEE SADARA A'NHAL A'ALAM\nO Allah! O Lord of the power due to which the world has been brought into existence,\nمُكَوَّنًا مَبْرُوْۤءًا عَلَيْهَا مَفْطُوْرًا تَحْتَ ظِلِّ الْعَظَمَةِ\nMUKAWWANAN MABROO'AN A'LAYHAA MAFTOORAN TAHTA ZILLIL A'ZAMAH\ncreated, and originated under the shadow of magnificence.\nفَنَطَقَتْ شَوَاهِدُ صُنْعِكَ فِيْهِ بِاَنَّكَ اَنْتَ اللّٰهُ لَاۤ اِلٰهَ اِلَّاۤ اَنْتَ\nFANATAQAT SHAWAAHIDU SUN'IKA FEEHI BI-ANNAKA ANTALLAAHU LAA ILAAHA ILLAA ANT\nSo, the witnesses of Your making in it have witnessed that You are Allah; there is no god save You,\nمُكَوِّنُهٗ وَبَارِئُهٗ وَفَاطِرُهُ ابْتَدَعْتَهٗ\nMUKAWWINUHOO WA BAARI'UHOO WA FAATIRUHUB TADA'TAH\nthe Maker, Creator, and Originator of it. You have invented it\nلَا مِنْ شَيْ‏ءٍ وَلَا عَلٰى شَيْ‏ءٍ وَلَا فِي شَيْ‏ءٍ\nLAA MIN SHAY'IN WA LAA A'LAA SHAY'IN WA LAA FEE SHAY'\nfrom no precedent sample, on account of nothing, in nothing,\nوَلَا لِوَحْشَةٍ دَخَلَتْ عَلَيْكَ اِذْ لَا غَيْرُكَ\nWA LAA LIWAHSHATIN DAKHALAT A'LAYKA IDH LAA GHAYRUK\nnot for feeling of loneliness that You may experience because there is none save You,\nوَلَا حَاجَةٍ بَدَتْ لَكَ فِيْ تَكْوِيْنِهٖ\nWA LAA HAAJATIN BADAT LAKA FEE TAKWEENIH\nnot for any need that caused You to make it,\nوَلَا لِاِسْتِعَانَةٍ مِنْكَ عَلَى الْخَلْقِ بَعْدَهٗ\nWA LAA LI-ISTI'AANATIN MINKA A'LAL KHALQI BA'DAH\nand not for the reason that it may help You create more after it.\nبَلْ اَنْشَاْتَهٗ لِيَكُوْنَ دَلِيْلًا عَلَيْكَ بِاَنَّكَ بَائِنٌ مِنَ الصُّنْعِ\nBAL ANSHA'TAHOO LIYAKOONA DALEELAN A'LAYKA BI-ANNAKA BAA'INUN MINAS SUN'\nRather, You have formed it so that it would act as proof (on the fact) that You are too far above being made.\nفَلَا يُطِيْقُ الْمُنْصِفُ لِعَقْلِهٖ اِنْكَارَكَ\nFALAA YUTEEQUL MUNSIFU LI-A'QLIHEE INKAARAK\nSo, the fair-minded cannot deny You\nوَالْمَوْسُوْمُ بِصِحَّةِ الْمَعْرِفَةِ جُحُوْدَكَ\nWAL MAWSOOMU BISIHHATIL MA'RIFATI JUHOODAK\nand the sound knowledgeable cannot refute You.\nاَسْاَلُكَ بِشَرَفِ الْاِخْلَاصِ فِيْ تَوْحِيْدِكَ،\nAS'ALUKA BISHARAFIL IKHLAASI FEE TAWHEEDIK\nI thus beseech You by the honor of sincere belief in Your Oneness,\nوَحُرْمَةِ التَّعَلُّقِ بِكِتَابِكَ وَاَهْلِ بَيْتِ نَبِيِّكَ\nWA HURMATIT TA'ALLUQI BIKITAABIKA WA AHLI BAYTI NABIYYIK\nthe holiness of abidance by Your Book, and the Household of Your Prophet\nاَنْ تُصَلِّيَ عَلٰۤى اٰدَمَ بَدِيْعِ فِطْرَتِكَ وَبِكْرِ حُجَّتِكَ\nAN TUSALLIYA A'LAA AADAMA BADEE'I FITRATIKA WA BIKRI HUJJATIK\nto send blessings upon Adam the example on Your creation, the foremost of Your Argument,\nوَلِسَانِ قُدْرَتِكَ وَالْخَلِيْفَةِ فِيْ بَسِيْطَتِكَ\nWA LISAANI QUDRATIKA WAL KHALEEFATI FEE BASEETATIK\nthe spokesman of Your omnipotence, and the representative of You on Your lands\nوَعَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ الْخَالِصِ مِنْ صَفْوَتِكَ\nWA A'LAA MUHAMMADINIL KHAALISI MIN SAFWATIK\nand upon Muhammad the choicest of Your choice,\nوَالْفَاحِصِ عَنْ مَعْرِفَتِكَ\nWAL FAAHISI A'N MA'RIFATIK\nthe evidence on the recognition of You,\nوَالْغَاۤئِصِ الْمَاْمُوْنِ عَلٰى مَكْنُوْنِ سَرِيْرَتِكَ\nWAL GHAA'ISIL MA'MOONI A'LAA MAKNOONI SAREERATIK\nthe profound, and the trustee on Your most hidden secrets\nبِمَاۤ اَوْلَيْتَهٗ مِنْ نِعْمَتِكَ بِمَعُوْنَتِكَ\nBIMAA AWLAYTAHOO MIN NI'MATIKA BIMA'OONATIK\ndue to Your grace that You have bestowed upon him out of Your aid;\nوَعَلٰى مَنْ بَيْنَهُمَا مِنَ النَّبِيِّيْنَ وَالْمُكَرَّمِيْنَ وَالْاَوْصِيَاۤءِ وَالصِّدِّيْقِيْنَ\nWA A'LAA MAN BAYNAHUMAA MINAN NABIYYEENA WAL MUKARRAMEENA WAL AWSIYAA'I WAS SIDDEEQEEN\nand (send blessings) upon the Prophets, the honored ones, the Prophets’ successors, and the truthful ones who came between these two;\nوَاَنْ تَهَبَنِيْ لِاِمَامِيْ هٰذَا.\nWA AN TAHABANEE LI-IMAAMEE HAADHAA\nand to forgive me for the sake of this Imam, my leader.",
    "Cheek on the Tomb\nPlace your cheek on the tomb and recite:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ بِمَحَلِّ هٰذَا السَّيِّدِ مِنْ طَاعَتِكَ وَبِمَنْزِلَتِهٖ عِنْدَكَ\nALLAAHUMMA BIMAHALLI HAADHAS SAYYIDI MIN TAA'ATIKA WA BIMANZILATIHEE I'NDAK\nO Allah, (I beseech You) by the position of this chief as regards his obedience to You and by the rank of him with You,\nلَا تُمِتْنِيْ فُجَاۤءَةً وَلَا تَحْرِمْنِيْ تَوْبَةً\nLAA TUMITNEE FUJAA'ATAN WA LAA TAHRIMNEE TAWBAH\ndo not grasp my soul suddenly, do not deprive me of repentance,\nوَارْزُقْنِيْ الْوَرَعَ عَنْ مَحَارِمِكَ دِيْنًا وَدُنْيَا\nWARZUQNIL WARA'A A'N MAHAARIMIKA DEENAN WA DUNYAA\nmake me stop at the worldly and religious matters that You have deemed forbidden,\nوَاشْغَلْنِيْ بِالْاٰخِرَةِ عَنْ طَلَبِ الْاُوْلٰى\nWASHGHALNEE BIL AAKHIRATI A'N TALABIL OOLAA\nmake my engagement in the affairs of my Next World distract me from the affairs of this worldly life,\nوَوَفِّقْنِيْ لِمَا تُحِبُّ وَتَرْضٰى\nWA WAFFIQNEE LIMAA TUHIBBU WA TARDAA\nlead me successfully to all that which You please and like,\nوَجَنِّبْنِيْ اتِّبَاعَ الْهَوٰى وَالْاِغْتِرَارَ بِالْاَبَاطِيْلِ وَالْمُنٰى\nWA JANNIBNIT TIBAA'AL HAWAA WAL IGHTIRAARA BIL ABAATEELI WAL MUNAA\nand keep me away from following my own whims and being seduced by abortive acts and deceitful expectations.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلِ السَّدَادَ فِيْ قَوْلِيْ وَالصَّوَابَ فِيْ فِعْلِيْ\nALLAAHUMMAJ A'LIS SADAADA FEE QAWLEE WAS SAWAABA FEE FI'LEE\nO Allah, (please do) make all my speech apposite, all my deeds correct,\nوَالصِّدْقَ وَالْوَفَاۤءَ فِيْ ضَمَانِيْ وَوَعْدِيْ\nWAS SIDQA WAL WAFAA'A FEE DAMAANEE WA WA'DEE\nand all my pledges and covenants truthful and honest,\nوَالْحِفْظَ وَالْاِيْنَاسَ مَقْرُوْنَيْنِ بِعَهْدِيْ وَوَعْدِيْ\nWAL HIFZA WAL EENAASA MAQROONAYNI BI-A'HDEE WA WA'DEE\nadd fulfillment and amiability to my oaths and promises,\nوَالْبِرَّ وَالْاِحْسَانَ مِنْ شَاْنِيْ وَخُلُقِيْ\nWAL BIRRA WAL IHSAANA MIN SHA'NEE WA KHULUQEE\nadd righteousness and good-doing to my conduct and morals,\nوَاجْعَلِ السَّلَامَةَ لِيْ شَامِلَةً وَالْعَافِيَةَ بِيْ مُحِيْطَةً مُلْتَفَّةً\nWAJ'ALIS SALAAMATA LEE SHAAMILATAN WAL A'AFIYATA BEE MUHEETATAN MULTAFFAH\ngrant me comprehensive safety, make good health encompass and include me,\nوَلَطِيْفَ صُنْعِكَ وَعَوْنِكَ مَصْرُوْفًا اِلَيَّ\nWA LATEEFA SUN'IKA WA A'WNIKA MASROOFAN ILAYY\nmake Your kind making and aid direct towards me,\nوَحُسْنَ تَوْفِيْقِكَ وَيُسْرِكَ مَوْفُوْرًا عَلَيَّ\nWA HUSNA TAWFEEQIKA WA YUSRIKA MAWFOORAN A'LAYY\nmake Your granting of success and prosperity flow towards me abundantly,\nوَاَحْيِنِيْ يَا رَبِّ سَعِيْدًا، وَتَوَفَّنِيْ شَهِيْدًا\nWA AHYINEE YAA RABBI SA'EEDAN WA TAWAFFANEE SHAHEEDAA\nmake me live, O my Lord, with happiness, grasp my soul as martyr,\nوَطَهِّرْنِيْ لِلْمَوْتِ وَمَا بَعْدَهٗ\nWA TAHHIRNEE LIL MAWTI WA MAA BA'DAH\nand purify me for death and what is beyond.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَاجْعَلِ الصِّحَّةَ وَالنُّوْرَ فِيْ سَمْعِيْ وَبَصَرِيْ\nALLAAHUMMA WAJ'ALIS SIHHATA WAN NOORA FEE SAM'EE WA BASAREE\nO Allah, add health and light to my hearing and sight,\nوَالْجِدَةَ وَالْخَيْرَ فِيْ طُرُقِيْ\nWAL JIDATA WAL KHAYRA FEE TURUQEE\nadd straightness and goodness to my courses,\nوَالْهُدٰى وَالْبَصِيْرَةَ فِيْ دِيْنِيْ وَمَذْهَبِيْ\nWAL HUDAA WAL BASEERATA FEE DEENEE WA MADH-HABEE\nadd true guidance and insight to my belief and faith,\nوَالْمِيْزَانَ اَبَدًا نَصْبَ عَيْنِيْ\nWAL MEEZAANA ABADAN NASBA A'YNEE\nmake the Scale of deeds always before my eyes,\nوَالذِّكْرَ وَالْمَوْعِظَةَ شِعَارِيْ وَدِثَارِيْ\nWADH DHIKRA WAL MAW'IZATA SHI'AAREE WA DITHAAREE\nmake remembrance of You and exhortation to be my layer and cover,\nوَالْفِكْرَةَ وَالْعِبْرَةَ اُنْسِيْ وَعِمَادِيْ\nWAL FIKRATA WAL I'BRATA UNSEE WA I'MAADEE\nmake pondering and learning lessons (from others) to be my entertainment and basis,\nوَمَكِّنِ الْيَقِيْنَ فِيْ قَلْبِيْ\nWA MAKKINIL YAQEENA FEE QALBEE\nmake my heart open its doors to conviction,\nوَاجْعَلْهُ اَوْثَقَ الْاَشْيَاۤءِ فِيْ نَفْسِيْ\nWAJ'ALHU AWTHAQAL ASHYAA'I FEE NAFSEE\nmake it the most certain thing in myself,\nوَاغْلِبْهُ عَلٰى رَاْيِيْ وَعَزْمِيْ\nWAGHLIBHU A'LAA RA'YEE WA A'ZMEE\nmake it prevail on my views and determinations,\nوَاجْعَلِ الْاِرْشَادَ فِيْ عَمَلِيْ\nWAJ'ALIL IRSHAADA FEE A'MALEE\nadd true direction to my deeds,\nوَالتَّسْلِيْمَ لِاَمْرِكَ مِهَادِيْ وَسَنَدِيْ\nWAT TASLEEMA LI-AMRIKA MIHAADEE WA SANADEE\nmake my submission to Your decisions to be my bed and my support,\nوَالرِّضَا بِقَضَاۤئِكَ وَقَدَرِكَ اَقْصٰى عَزْمِيْ وَنِهَايَتِيْ وَاَبْعَدَ هَمِّيْ وَغَايَتِيْ\nWAR RIDAA BIQADAA'IKA WA QADARIKA AQSAA A'ZMEE WA NIHAAYATEE WA AB'ADA HAMMEE WA GHAAYATEE\nand make my satisfaction with Your acts to be my utmost purpose, end result, and the furthest of my reason and intention\nحَتّٰى لَاۤ اَتَّقِيَ اَحَدًا مِنْ خَلْقِكَ بِدِيْنِيْ\nHATTAA LAA ATTAQIYA AHADAN MIN KHALQIKA BIDEENEE\nso that I shall not fear anybody in matters appertained to my religion,\nوَلَاۤ اَطْلُبُ بِهٖ غَيْرَ اٰخِرَتِيْ\nWA LAA ATLUBU BIHEE GHAYRA AAKHIRATEE\nI shall intend for nothing other than success in my Next Life,\nوَلَاۤ اَسْتَدْعِيَ مِنْهُ اِطْرَاۤئِيْ وَمَدْحِيْ\nWA LAA ASTAD'IYA MINHU ITRAA'EE WA MAD-HEE\nand I shall not hope for praise or approval for it.\nوَاجْعَلْ خَيْرَ الْعَوَاقِبِ عَاقِبَتِيْ،\nWAJ'AL KHAYRAL A'WAAQIBI A'AQIBATEE\nAnd (please do) make my end result to be the best of all,\nوَخَيْرَ الْمَصَاۤئِرِ مَصِيْرِيْ\nWA KHAYRAL MASAA'IRI MASEEREE\nmake my destiny to be the best of all,\nوَاَنْعَمَ الْعَيْشِ عَيْشِيْ\nWA AN'AMAL A'YSHI A'YSHEE\nmake my livelihood to be the most luxurious of all,\nوَاَفْضَلَ الْهُدٰى هُدَايَ\nWA AFDALAL HUDAA HUDAAY\nlead me to the truest guidance,\nوَاَوْفَرَ الْحُظُوْظِ حَظِّيْ\nWA AWFARAL HUZOOZI HAZZEE\nmake my portion to be the most abundant,\nوَاَجْزَلَ الْاَقْسَامِ قِسْمِيْ وَنَصِيْبِيْ\nWA AJZALAL AQSAAMI QISMEE WA NASEEBEE\nmake my share to be the largest,\nوَكُنْ لِيْ يَا رَبِّ مِنْ كُلِّ سُوْۤءٍ وَلِيًّا\nWA KUN LEE YAA RABBI MIN KULLI SOO'IN WALIYYAA\nand (please), O my Lord, be my guardian against all evils,\nوَاِلٰى كُلِّ خَيْرٍ دَلِيْلًا وَقَاۤئِدًا\nWA ILAA KULLI KHAYRIN DALEELAN WA QAA'IDAA\nmy guide and leader to all decencies,\nوَمِنْ كُلِّ بَاغٍ وَحَسُوْدٍ ظَهِيْرًا وَمَانِعًا\nWA MIN KULLI BAAGHIN WA HASOODIN ZAHEERAN WA MAANI'AA\nand my backer and protector against all oppressors and envious ones.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ بِكَ اعْتِدَادِيْ وَعِصْمَتِيْ وَثِقَتِيْ وَتَوْفِيْقِيْ\nALLAAHUMMA BIKA' TIDAADEE WA I'SMATEE WA THIQATEE WA TAWFEEQEE\nO Allah, to You do I resort, with You do I seek protection, in You do I trust, from You do I seek success,\nوَحَوْلِيْ وَقُوَّتِيْ\nWA HAWLEE WA QUWWATEE\nfrom You do I derive might and power,\nوَلَكَ مَحْيَايَ وَمَمَاتِيْ\nWA LAKA MAHYAAYA WA MAMAATEE\nin Your hands are my life and death,\nوَفِيْ قَبْضَتِكَ سُكُوْنِيْ وَحَرَكَتِيْ\nWA FEE QABDATIKA SUKOONEE WA HARAKATEE\nunder Your control are all my stillness and motions,\nوَاِنَّ بِعُرْوَتِكَ الْوُثْقَى اسْتِمْسَاكِيْ وَوُصْلَتِيْ\nWA INNA BI-U'RWATIKAL WUTHQAS TIMSAAKEE WA WUSLATEE\nby Your Firmest Handle do I abide, to it do I connect,\nوَعَلَيْكَ فِيْ الْاُمُوْرِ كُلِّهَا اعْتِمَادِيْ وَتَوَكُّلِيْ\nWA A'LAYKA FIL UMOORI KULLIHA' TIMAADEE WA TAWAKKULEE\non You do I rely and depend in all of my affairs,\nوَمِنْ عَذَابِ جَهَنَّمَ وَمَسِّ سَقَرَ نَجَاتِيْ وَخَلَاصِيْ\nWA MIN A'DHAABI JAHANNAMA WA MASSI SAQARA NAJAATEE WA KHALAASEE\nand from You do I seek salvation and redemption against the chastisement of Hell and the touch of Hellfire.\nوَفِيْ دَارِ اَمْنِكَ وَكَرَامَتِكَ مَثْوَايَ وَمُنْقَلَبِيْ\nWA FEE DAARI AMNIKA WA KARAAMATIKA MATHWAAYA WA MUNQALABEE\nSo (please), decide my final house to be in the abode of Your security and honor\nوَعَلٰۤى اَيْدِيْ سَادَتِيْ وَمَوَالِيَّ اٰلِ الْمُصْطَفٰى فَوْزِيْ وَفَرَجِيْۤ\nWA A'LAA AYDEE SAADATEE WA MAWAALIYYA AALIL MUSTAFAA FAWZEE WA FARAJEE\nand my success and relief to be at the hands of my masters and chiefs the Household of the Chosen Prophet.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nO Allah, send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَاغْفِرْ لِلْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَالْمُؤْمِنَاتِ وَالْمُسْلِمِيْنَ وَالْمُسْلِمَاتِ\nWAGHFIR LIL MU'MINEENA WAL MU'MINAATI WAL MUSLIMEENA WAL MUSLIMAAT\nforgive the believing men and women and Muslim men and women,\nوَاغْفِرْ لِيْ وَلِوَالِدَيَّ وَمَا وَلَدَا وَاَهْلِ بَيْتِيْ وَجِيْرَانِيْ\nWAGHFIR LEE WA LIWAALIDAYYA WA MAA WALADAA WA AHLI BAYTEE WA JEERAANEE\nforgive me, my parents, their descendants, my family members, my neighbors,\nوَلِكُلِّ مَنْ قَلَّدَنِيْ يَدًا مِنَ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَالْمُؤْمِنَاتِ\nWA LIKULLI MAN QALLADANEE YADAN MINAL MU'MINEENA WAL MU'MINAAT\nand all the believing men and women for whom I concern.\nاِنَّكَ ذُوْ فَضْلٍ عَظِيْمٍ.\nINNAKA DHOO FADLIN A'ZEEM\nVerily, You are the Lord of immense favor.\nوَالسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهُ\nWAS SALAAMU A'LAYKA WA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nPeace and Allah’s mercy and blessings be upon you.\nAfter the ziyarat, recite [Dua Aliyat al-Madhamin](E3)."
