  "merits": "This form of ziyarah can be said during visiting all the Holy Imams in all months and days. In his book of Misbah al-Za’ir, Sayyid Ibn Tawus has reported this form of ziyarah from the Holy Imams along with certain etiquettes, including supplications and a prayer that is offered at leaving for the pilgrimage to the shrines of the Holy Imams."
